### example_log select data
GET /data/select HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "index": "traceId",
  "hit": {
    "conditions": [
      {
        "param": "traceId",
        "compare": "EQ",
        "compareValue": "b5d286f11a114726aa7980a3fbdd97c8"
      }
    ]
  }
}